                                                "sense_id": "785423b9-b67a-3fdf-9381-adcccba8b566",
                                                "text": "[I]f thou would’ſt farce thy leane Ribs with it [pork] too, they would not (like ragged Lathes) rub out ſo many Dublets as they do: […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
